      954     DEFINE VARIABLE adm-first-table         AS ROWID NO-UNDO.
      955     DEFINE VARIABLE adm-second-table        AS ROWID NO-UNDO.
      956     DEFINE VARIABLE adm-third-table         AS ROWID NO-UNDO.
