     1394     DEFINE INPUT PARAMETER p-issuer-hdl AS HANDLE    NO-UNDO.
     1395     DEFINE INPUT PARAMETER p-state      AS CHARACTER NO-UNDO.
     1396     CASE p-state:
     1397     END CASE.
     1398   END PROCEDURE.
